1. `/speckit-constitution` — amend only with user approval
2. `/speckit-specify` → `/speckit-clarify` (if needed) → `/speckit-plan` → `/speckit-tasks` → `/speckit-analyze` → `/speckit-implement` (implement **only after user OK**)

